    "The HuggingFace Hub keeps a duplicate blob cache alongside each downloaded model. Deleting it is safe — the working model files are untouched." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the HuggingFace Hub cache.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "The message to send to the AI assistant." : {

    },
    "The model downloads from HuggingFace on first use and is cached locally. Unloading frees memory; deleting removes the download." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "الموديل ينزل من HuggingFace أول مرة ويتخزن عندك. تفريغه يحرر الذاكرة؛ حذفه يزيل الملف"
          }
        },
        "az" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Model ilk açanda HuggingFace-dən endirilir və saxlanılır. Çıxarmaq yaddaş boşalır, silmə ise yüklənməni silib salır."
          }
        },
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Моделът се сваля от HuggingFace при първо използване и се кешира локално. Разтоварването освобождава памет; изтриването премахва файла."
          }
        },
        "bn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "মডেল HuggingFace থেকে প্রথমবার ডাউনলোড হয় এবং লোকালি সেভ থাকে। আনলোড করলে মেমরি খালি হয়, ডিলিট করলে ডাউনলোড গেলো।"
          }
        },
        "bo" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "མདེལ་གཞི་འདི་ HuggingFace ལ་དུས་བྱེད་དང་པོ་ལ་ཕ་གི། ཁོ་མ་ཡོད་ཀྱི་ཆ་ན་ཉར་ཡོད། སྐུར་བཞི་མ་ཡིན་ན་ཚད་གཞི་རགས། སྤོར་ན་ཕ་རིས་གཏོང་།"
          }
        },
        "bs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Model se preuzima sa HuggingFace-a pri prvoj upotrebi i keširuje lokalno. Otpuštanje oslobađa memoriju; brisanje uklanja preuzimanje"
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El model es descarrega des de HuggingFace en el primer ús i es guarda localment. Descarregar allibera memòria; eliminar borra la descàrrega."
          }
        },
        "ceb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ang model ay nag-download mula HuggingFace sa first use at naka-cache locally. Ang pag-unload ay naglalabas ng memory; ang pag-delete ay nag-aalis ng download."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Model se stáhne z HuggingFace při prvním použití a uloží se lokálně. Odtížení uvolní paměť, smazání ho odebere."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Modellen hentes fra HuggingFace første gang og caches lokalt. Aflæsning frigør hukommelse; sletning fjerner det."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Modell wird bei der ersten Verwendung von HuggingFace heruntergeladen und lokal zwischengespeichert. Entladen gibt Speicher frei; Löschen entfernt den Download."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Το μοντέλο κατεβαίνει από το HuggingFace στην πρώτη χρήση και κρατιέται τοπικά. Η εκφόρτωση ελευθερώνει μνήμη, η διαγραφή αφαιρεί το download."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The model downloads from HuggingFace on first use and gets cached locally. Unloading frees up memory; deleting removes the download."
